      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いいか、お前たち！　いきなり強い武具が\r\n手に入ったら、それはそれで面白くないぞっ！",
        "official_en": "Listen well, curs! It takes all the fun out of fighting when you get overpowered equipment right off the bat!",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
