      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いい気分だぜ！　盗られるばかりじゃなくて\r\n盗るほうを一度やってみたかったんだ！",
        "official_en": "Serves you right! I’ve been stolen from far too many times... But this time, the stealee becomes the stealer!",
        "real_en": "Ha! That feels good! I'm always the one getting robbed. I've wanted to try being the thief for once!"
      },
