      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "そっちの金髪の剣士！\r\n元気だけはあるようだな！\r\nお前の戦い方を、調べてやろう！",
        "official_en": "You there, blond whelp! You seem to be full of spunk. Let me size you up!",
        "real_en": "You, the blond swordsman! You've certainly got plenty of energy! Let's see how you fight!"
